  exerciseNumber: 11
  exerciseName: CannotPickUpPistol
  exerciseTitle: Cannot pick up Pistol
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63459469
  exerciseText: Cannot pick up pistol
  hintText: Does the pistol have a collider? Is it 2D? What other parameters are
    there on the Physics2D.OverlapCircleAll();?
  solutionText: The Pistol object is on the IgnoreRaycast layer which means it gets
    ignored by Physics queries, change it to anything else, like the Default layer,
    and it will be found.
